  "packageSize": 20759,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/krauthaufen/puresg/",
  "published": "2026-06-18T09:19:21.237Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- fix: MSBuild integration works on Windows. The `files`/`references` paths embedded in the tool's JSON args file were NOT forward-slashed (only `projectFile`/`outputPath` were), so on Windows a raw `C:\\Users\\…` path put invalid `\\U`-style escapes inside a JSON string — `JsonDocument.Parse` threw and the tool exited 5 (`error MSB3075: dotnet pureview … exited with code 5`). It only ever ran on Linux before, where every path is already `/`. Now every path is `.Replace('\\','/')`-normalised (FCS accepts forward slashes on Windows).",
  "title": "Adaptify.PureView.MSBuild",
  "verbatimVersion": "0.1.11",
